# Core stream lifecycle; acceptance and source identities belong to Org.
title: STREAMING / AUTHORITY BEFORE IRREVERSIBLE SEND {
  class: title
  near: top-center
}
semantics: Scheme / POO message contract\nComplete action / recipient / source cut / cost bound / finite lease {
  top: 0
  left: 220
  width: 1000
  height: 90
  class: semantic
}
producer: GO / BOUNDED PRODUCER {
  top: 230
  left: 0
  width: 340
  height: 860
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 18
  style.fill: "#f7f9fc"
  style.stroke: "#9cacc2"
  brand: "" {
    shape: image
    icon: assets/go.svg
    top: 14
    left: 14
    width: 46
    height: 20
  }
  assemble: Assemble complete message\nBounded framing / staging {
    top: 85
    left: 25
    width: 290
    height: 90
    class: cloud
  }
  wait: Wait without send authority\nNo upstream socket / no grant {
    top: 300
    left: 25
    width: 290
    height: 90
    class: cloud
  }
  freeze: Freeze exact semantic operation\nMessage / actor / stream / peer {
    top: 515
    left: 25
    width: 290
    height: 90
    class: cloud
  }
}
coord: RUST / DURABLE ADMISSION {
  top: 230
  left: 450
  width: 430
  height: 860
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 18
  style.fill: "#f8f9fc"
  style.stroke: "#a3abc0"
  brand: "" {
    shape: image
    icon: assets/rust.svg
    top: 14
    left: 14
    width: 30
    height: 30
  }
  prepare: Prepare current child operation\nSplit parent escrow / hold credits {
    top: 85
    left: 35
    width: 360
    height: 90
    class: ledger
  }
  authority: Message policy / original consume\nComplete error-free Cedar checks {
    top: 270
    left: 35
    width: 360
    height: 90
    class: policy
  }
  eligible: Commit exact queue eligibility\nSource / history / budget / audit {
    top: 455
    left: 35
    width: 360
    height: 90
    class: ledger
  }
  queue: Bounded physical queue\nCommitted ID / immutable data {
    top: 640
    left: 35
    width: 360
    height: 90
    class: cloud
  }
}
writer: RUST / PARENT-BOUND WRITER {
  top: 230
  left: 1030
  width: 430
  height: 860
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 18
  style.fill: "#f7f9fc"
  style.stroke: "#9cacc2"
  claim: Claim this message once\nTyped handle / one ordered writer {
    top: 85
    left: 35
    width: 360
    height: 90
    class: runtime
  }
  ticket: Commit bounded offer intent\nCAS against active stream epoch {
    top: 270
    left: 35
    width: 360
    height: 90
    class: runtime
  }
  offer: Constrained range submission\nExact bytes / peer / deadline {
    top: 455
    left: 35
    width: 360
    height: 90
    class: runtime
  }
  observe: Record offered / partial / unknown\nNever replay an ambiguous prefix {
    top: 640
    left: 35
    width: 360
    height: 90
    class: ledger
  }
}
peer: Bound upstream stream\nAttributable observations {
  top: 685
  left: 1650
  width: 250
  height: 90
  class: ledger
}
seal: Seal stream / advance epoch\nNo fresh admission / claim / ticket {
  top: 1240
  left: 485
  width: 360
  height: 105
  class: deny
}
retire: Retire delegated submission rights\nMemory release and cost settlement differ {
  top: 1240
  left: 1065
  width: 360
  height: 105
  class: ledger
}
semantics -> producer: Message definition / projection
semantics -> coord: Admitted owner contract
producer.assemble -> producer.wait
producer.wait -> producer.freeze
producer.freeze -> coord.prepare: Complete bound message
coord.prepare -> coord.authority
coord.authority -> coord.eligible: Positive consume is necessary
coord.eligible -> coord.queue: Queue authority / held capacity
coord.queue -> writer.claim: Repeat IDs / never repeat rights
writer.claim -> writer.ticket
writer.ticket -> writer.offer: Fixed range authority
writer.offer -> peer: Admitted bytes only
peer -> writer.observe
writer.observe -> retire: Independent retirement / usage
writer.ticket -> seal: Seal wins / ticket refused
seal -> retire: Stop / drain / quarantine
accounts: Held / settled / unknown accounting\nSpent claims remain terminal {
  top: 1450
  left: 485
  width: 360
  height: 105
  class: ledger
}
writer.offer -> writer.observe: Local offered / unknown
retire -> accounts: Admit accounting evidence
rule: "One semantic message slot and one application writer per stream; other producers stage inert data.\nPre-cut range authority can outlive a seal observation. Unknown prefixes and costs never recreate send rights or free capacity." {
  shape: text
  class: note
  near: bottom-center
}

